OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuations after suspicious
OL,4,Aenvelopes found
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic buildings, offices, homes and
OL,7,Froads were closed after two suspicious
OL,8,Fenvelopes were found at a council
OL,9,Fbuilding.
OL,11,FHertsmere Borough Council said a 100m
OL,12,F(328ft) cordon was put in place by
OL,13,Fpolice after the items were discovered
OL,14,Fat the Civic Offices in Borehamwood,
OL,15,FHertfordshire, on Wednesday.
OL,17,FChris Gray, the cabinet member for
OL,18,Fcommunity safety, said the response
OL,19,Ffollowed not only the suspicious
OL,20,Fenvelopes but also a "serious death
OL,21,Fthreat" aimed at the council leader
OL,22,Fmade in recent months.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
